WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:02.753
Masoud:
You have forty seven
minutes.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.796
Masoud:
Stay in communication with me.

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.341
Masoud:
Do what you have to do.

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:09.426
♪♪

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:10.928
I will be home by tomorrow
afternoon.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.024
Masoud:
The coast is clear.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.317
Take care of the package.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:26.944
I'm in.

00:00:26.944 --> 00:00:27.945
Copy that.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.036
The cops are here, you have to
get out.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.287
Tamar:
I'm almost done.

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:46.922
♪♪

00:00:46.922 --> 00:00:48.048
Masoud:
The mission is burned.

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:50.634
They're onto you now.

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:53.470
♪♪

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:04.648
Masoud:
I will get you out.

00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:05.774
I'll do whatever it takes.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.361
Tamar:
I need your help.

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:11.321
The police are looking for me.

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:12.698
Tamar:
They're questioning everyone
here.

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:17.160
♪♪

00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:22.833
Faraz:
If you lie to me,

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.044
Faraz:
you're not gonna make it home
alive.

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:30.465
♪♪

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:32.759
If I were you, I'd get my
revenge on all of Tehran.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:34.261
♪♪

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:37.931
Faraz:
You have to admit that. Do not
test me.

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:47.190
Tamar:
We're not gonna get another
chance.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:50.527
♪♪

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:55.782
♪♪

00:01:58.702 --> 00:02:02.831
♪♪

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:04.207
Tamar:
There's no going back now.

